# Gmail SMTP Email Configuration
# 1. Go to Google Account > Security > 2-Step Verification
# 2. At the bottom, select 'App passwords'
# 3. Generate a password for 'Mail' / 'Portfolio Backend'
# 4. Paste the 16-character App Password below:

SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_SECURE=true
SMTP_USER=jeevankumar3229@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your_16_digit_app_password_here
